{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"notes\": {\n    \"甲\": \"甲版清楚解释了安稳曾经真实发生、却不能保证继续留存，因而回返虽能重新唤起珍惜，却不足以恢复把握，并进一步写出身体先于念头认出失重、反复加力的无效与消耗又使他转向低沉收住的因果链；相对不足之处是部分关于尊严、秩序和未来愿望的解释超出了这段听感能够直接支持的范围，且若干因果反复围绕努力无法保证幸福留存这一点展开。\",\n    \"乙\": \"乙版通过先前挺立无法挽回过去、敞开未获回应、短暂喘息又预感别离以及反复聚力造成的消耗，说明了为何此刻只能断续触及珍惜之物，并把长期耗竭与失重、迟疑联系起来；但它对这些因素如何共同触发眼前的转折交代得较为概括，尤其没有充分展开身体先于念头的反应，也没有像甲版那样具体说明反复加力为何逐渐转变为收住自己。\"\n  },\n  \"verdict\": \"甲 版不差于 乙 版\",\n  \"why\": \"甲版的优势不在篇幅或故事完整度，而在于更具体地连接了过去经验、当下触发、身体反应与应对方式的改变，因此对他此刻为何这样感受的解释至少不逊于乙版。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "78a5b811-df80-465b-91b8-d81023a742ee", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T134438677420Z", "elapsed_seconds": 41.844, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:45:20.529486+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a72597dde580e77f5f43381cc606b66a238f7f25d7de6a658661ae36bdfa5bf3", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0